<p>I'd like to reaffirm cybersqyd's point about human time loops but also posit the query of why the future-Foundation doesn't have access to the present-day SCP file about the spacecraft, if time is so circular and all. You know, surely someone in the present-day would have written it down somewhere that they do an abiogenesis at the particular date that the space-craft takes off.</p>
